        "nodeType": "bounded_task",
        "objective": "Implement TASK-0093 acceptance criteria in\nsrc/ahra/alignment_session.py. 1) draft_request runs the Acceptance\nAgent first, reading only the frozen boundary contract; every Claim\ncriterionRefs entry must reference a boundary entry ID; capture the\nClaimGraph sha256 digest in the session snapshot before the\nRequirement Agent is invoked. 2) The Requirement Agent payload\nincludes the boundary contract and the frozen ClaimGraph as\nread-only input; the accepted RequestDraft ClaimGraph must be\nbyte-identical to the frozen digest, and any divergence rejects the\ndraft as untrusted input. 3) A PlanDraft node claimRef that does not\nresolve to a claim ID in the frozen ClaimGraph rejects the draft\nwith a structured error naming the unresolved refs. Cover all three\nbehaviors with tests in tests/test_alignment_session.py. Run\nuv run python -B scripts/check.py and record it in\nWorkReport.verification_commands_run.\n",
